#: packages/claudia-computes/src/claudia_computes/functions
msgid "\"address\" ($A$1), \"row\", \"col\", \"contents\", \"type\" (b blank, l text, v other), \"sheet\", and the plain defaults \"format\" (G), \"prefix\", \"protect\", \"parentheses\", \"color\" and \"filename\". Others (\"width\") are #N/A: claudia has no column widths a formula can see."
